1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,800
You know the gun barrel, the shaken martini, the tuxedo and the Aston Martin.

2
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:09,160
Only six men have ever worn that suit, and on Monday the seventh was named.

3
00:00:09,160 --> 00:00:13,480
He is the same man who once died in a maze at the end of a wizard tournament, sparkled

4
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:18,440
