6
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:23,000
The studio did not pick him in spite of that strange road.

7
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:24,640
It picked him because of it.

8
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:29,720
This is the entire history of Robert Pattinson, the seventh James Bond, Robert Douglas Thomas

9
00:00:29,720 --> 00:00:36,000
Pattinson was born on the 13th of May 1986 in Barnes, a leafy corner of southwest London

10
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:37,400
