Twilight.

54
00:03:04,320 --> 00:03:10,040
The studio was nervous about the project, and the budget was modest, about $37 million.

55
00:03:10,040 --> 00:03:12,280
The director was Catherine Hardwick.

56
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:16,840
He auditioned opposite Kristen Stewart, and the chemistry in that scene is the reason the

57
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:18,040
