58
00:03:18,040 --> 00:03:19,560
He got the part.

59
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:22,080
The film came out in November 2008.

60
00:03:22,080 --> 00:03:25,480
It made roughly $400 million worldwide.

61
00:03:25,480 --> 00:03:27,920
Nobody at the studio had expected that.

62
00:03:27,920 --> 00:03:29,920
Twilight changed his life in a few weeks.

63
00:03:29,920 --> 00:03:34,760
He went from a quiet actor nobody recognized to a man who could not walk down a street.

64
00:03:34,760 --> 00:03:36,560
Fans waited outside hotels.

65
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:41,120
His face was on posters, on lunch boxes, and on magazine covers around the world.

66
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:46,280
Over the next four years, there were four more films, and the five Twilight films together

67
00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:48,920
