68
00:03:48,920 --> 00:03:53,440
He was one of the most famous young actors on earth, and for a while he was also one of

69
00:03:53,440 --> 00:03:54,960
the most uncomfortable.

70
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:59,000
He gave interviews where he made fun of the character, and fans took it as either charming

71
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:03,000
