72
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:05,720
But the truth he has since explained is simple.

73
00:04:05,720 --> 00:04:10,240
He was worried that he had been stuck in one role, and he had no idea how to be anything

74
00:04:10,240 --> 00:04:11,240
else.

75
00:04:11,240 --> 00:04:14,800
So he made a decision that most stars at that moment do not make.

76
00:04:14,880 --> 00:04:19,680
While Twilight was still running, he started choosing small films with hard directors.

77
00:04:19,680 --> 00:04:25,240
In 2012, he worked with David Cronenberg on Cosmopolus, a cold, strange film where he spent

78
00:04:25,240 --> 00:04:27,600
