100
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:45,800
He is sweaty, desperate and magnetic.

101
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:49,680
The film played at the Cannes Film Festival, and critics started to write that he was one

102
00:05:49,680 --> 00:05:52,360
of the best actors of his generation.

103
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:57,680
People who had laughed at him for being a vampire were now repeating that sentence in newspapers.

104
00:05:57,680 --> 00:06:02,920
By his own account, he reached out to the Safty Brothers himself, which tells you how he

105
00:06:02,920 --> 00:06:05,360
