106
00:06:05,360 --> 00:06:07,720
He was not waiting to be offered things.

107
00:06:07,720 --> 00:06:08,880
He was going after them.

108
00:06:08,880 --> 00:06:11,720
Then came a run of strange, ambitious films.

109
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:16,720
In 2018, he starred in High Life, a cold, dark space film from French director Claire

110
00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:17,720
Denis.

111
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:22,440
In 2019, he was in the King, a historical film with Timothy Shala, where he played the

112
00:06:22,440 --> 00:06:26,520
French Dauphin with a ridiculous accent and enormous confidence.

113
00:06:26,520 --> 00:06:29,560
And also in 2019, came the Lighthouse.

114
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:34,520
The film that for many people is the moment he became an actor, you could not ignore.

115
00:06:34,520 --> 00:06:39,080
It was directed by Robert Eggers and shot in black and white on film, in a cramped, wet

116
00:06:39,080 --> 00:06:42,000
