117
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:45,640
He and Willem Dafoe played two lighthouse keepers who slowly go mad.

118
00:06:45,640 --> 00:06:50,720
There are long speeches, strange noises, seagulls, and a lot of shouting at the weather.

119
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:55,160
It was exhausting to make and strange to watch, and critics loved it.

120
00:06:55,160 --> 00:07:00,080
If you wanted a single film to prove he had escaped Twilight, this was it by now big directors

121
00:07:00,080 --> 00:07:01,360
