130
00:07:35,080 --> 00:07:39,240
In May 2019, it was announced that he would be the next Batman.

131
00:07:39,240 --> 00:07:43,360
Warner Bros. had been looking for a new Bruce Wayne for Matt Reeves, who was directing

132
