143
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:17,720
It was long, rainy, quiet, almost a noir detective story.

144
00:08:17,720 --> 00:08:22,800
His Bruce Wayne was a young, damaged, sleepless recluse who barely leaves his house, and the

145
