156
00:09:01,800 --> 00:09:07,200
The box office did not match its budget, but many critics said it was one of his best performances.

157
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:12,000
In the same period, he starred opposite Jennifer Lawrence in Die, my love, directed by Lin

158
