Ramsey, a raw, uncomfortable film about a young couple, and the strain of new parenthood.

159
00:09:18,440 --> 00:09:20,920
Away from the camera, his life changed too.

160
00:09:20,920 --> 00:09:26,440
He and the actress and singer Sukeye Waterhouse have been together since 2018, and they have

161
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:29,480
