165
00:09:41,320 --> 00:09:44,840
He has also kept up the music he started as a teenager.

166
00:09:44,840 --> 00:09:49,920
Two of his songs even appeared on the Twilight soundtrack, and he still plays guitar and piano.

167
00:09:49,920 --> 00:09:53,200
This year, 2026 has been the busiest of his career.

168
00:09:53,200 --> 00:09:58,480
In April came the drama, an A24 film with Zendaya about a couple whose wedding plans are

169
00:09:58,480 --> 00:10:03,360
shaken by a secret, with Pattinson and Zendaya as the engaged couple, Wood.

170
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:08,920
In July came Christopher Nolan's The Odyssey, a huge adaptation of Homer's ancient epic,

171
00:10:08,920 --> 00:10:13,640
with Matt Damon, Tom Holland and Hathaway and Zendaya, and Pattinson playing Antinus.

172
00:10:13,640 --> 00:10:18,080
The leader of the suitors trying to take over Odysseus's home, in December he is set to

173
00:10:18,080 --> 00:10:19,600
