176
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:31,360
Then on the 16th of November 2026 came the news that shook everything.

177
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:35,680
Amazon's MGM Studios announced that Robert Pattinson is the new James Bond.

178
00:10:35,680 --> 00:10:40,120
Denis Villeneuve, the director of Dune, will direct the film from a script by Stephen

179
