Knight, and it will be the first Bond film made by Amazon.

180
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:46,320
There is no title and no release date yet.

181
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:50,080
It takes over from Daniel Craig, who played the part for five films.

182
00:10:50,080 --> 00:10:54,760
Villeneuve said he has the timeless soul of Aero 07 and brings a spirit that is completely

183
00:10:54,760 --> 00:11:00,040
new, and Pattinson said that calling the role a dream come true is an understatement.

184
00:11:00,040 --> 00:11:01,960
The idea is not new.

185
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:06,640
Back in 2019, the director Danny Boyle, who had been set to direct a Bond film before

186
00:11:06,640 --> 00:11:11,640
he left the project, said after watching High Life that Pattinson should be Bond.

187
00:11:11,640 --> 00:11:15,920
At the time the actor had only just been named Batman, and many people were still picturing

188
00:11:15,960 --> 00:11:17,440
a vampire.

189
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:21,440
Seven years later the vampire has the license to kill, so look at the whole path from

190
00:11:21,440 --> 00:11:22,440
the start.

191
00:11:22,440 --> 00:11:26,960
A boy in Barnes, whose modelling work dried up, a teenager in a small theatre group, a

192
00:11:26,960 --> 00:11:31,280
young man cut out of a film, a half a puff who died in a maze.

193
00:11:31,280 --> 00:11:36,080
Then a vampire who made billions, who was never sure he wanted the job, and who then chose

194
00:11:36,080 --> 00:11:39,440
a decade of difficult films to prove he was more than that.

195
00:11:39,440 --> 00:11:44,360
A man who reached out to directors and asked for work, who was laughed as Batman, and who

196
00:11:44,440 --> 00:11:47,400
now holds the most famous job in spy cinema.

197
00:11:47,400 --> 00:11:51,840
His whole career is the story of one stubborn decision, to turn fame into freedom.

198
00:11:51,840 --> 00:11:53,960
He did not run away from the vampire.

199
00:11:53,960 --> 00:11:57,760
He used the vampire to pay for everything that came afterward.

200
00:11:57,760 --> 00:12:00,640
And that is the real history of Robert Pattinson.

201
00:12:00,640 --> 00:12:02,560
It is not about luck or looks.

202
00:12:02,560 --> 00:12:06,960
It is the story of an actor who kept choosing the hard role, until the hardest and most

203
00:12:06,960 --> 00:12:08,520
